%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 489a87a09fc8cae4192c0aca61dfd148, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialoguesInfoConfig
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguesInfo:
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Oh, what a misfortune befell us! Son, I ask you, deal with the
        scoundrel who is causing all this to happen!
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Necessarily!
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Please, take care of yourself!
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Agreed.
      speaker: 0
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Son, I'm proud of you. The main thing is to come back alive. I
        hope this horror ends sooner or later. Have a successful trip!
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Right, thank you for everything, father.
      speaker: 0
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Hello, where are you going?
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: I'm going after the head of the man who caused the apocalypse.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Do you think someone is to blame for this?
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Sure. And I`m going to punish him no matter what.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Hm, so where do you go first? I don`t think you know much about
        other places besides Greenfield.
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Eh, you caught me.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Nah, you are naive as always!
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Ahah.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Are you sure about your decision to leave GreenField? I think
        it's too dangerous, especially for you.
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: No, I won`t stop only because of your warnings!
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: I knew it. Okay, first of all, I suggest you going to Milgard.
        It is quite a big town in the center of the field, where you will meet a
        lot of interesting and strong people. They`ll help you to grow, but not for
        free, of course.
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: I`he heard about it. Sounds amazing!
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Yeap, just follow the road and you`ll get there. Good luck and
        come back alive!
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Thank you, bye!
      speaker: 0
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: What do you want from me?
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: You don`t look great, can I help you?
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: It`s because of magic. Now leave me alone.
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Magic? Are you a magician?
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Not a professional, of course, but I can defend myself.
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: I also have to be able to defend myself. Can you teach me magic?
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: I also have to be able to defend myself. Can you teach me magic?
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: 'Why are you so obsessive? I told you to get out of here! '
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Please. I want to change the world for the better.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: I said...
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Please ^-^
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Oh, I didn't know what to do with the extra wooden staff anyway.
        Take it, then go to hell. I won`t teach you magic, I`m not good enough. The
        only thing I`ll tell you - you have to use mana to attack really effective.
        Bye.
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Excuse me...
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Who are you and where are you from?
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: I`m from Greenfield.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Oh, Greenfield, our neighbours! How did you survive the black
        tsunami?
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Half of our residents turned into monsters and fled in all directions.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: We had the same situation.
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: What a horror!
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Buy delicious food cheap!
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Professional Milgard shooter at your service.
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: You have a huge potential, man. Don`t be shy to ask to fix some
        mistakes you have made.
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Professional Milgard mage at your service.
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Professional Milgard potion master at your service.
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Good afternoon, sir.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Good afternoon. What brought you to Milgard, young man?
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: I want to become strong, I have to become strong to punish the
        person who made led to the apocalypse.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Well, so you are a novice monster slayer?
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: Yes.
      speaker: 0
    - replicaText: Then I have some tasks for you to do. Of course, you will be rewarded.
      speaker: 1
    - replicaText: I would be very grateful. I just needed to start somewhere.
      speaker: 0
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Professional Oakholme lumberjack master at your service.
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: Professional Oakholme blacksmith master at your service.
      speaker: 1
  - dialogue:
    - replicaText: "Shh\u2026 the boss sleeps. Wake him, and you\u2019ll be nothing
        but dust."
      speaker: 1
